Package: [[ name ]]
Architecture: [[ architecture ]]
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux [[ release ]] headers, with tools this machine can run
 The kernel headers of [[ release ]], which is built for [[ kernel_arch ]],
 together with the kbuild tools compiled for [[ architecture ]] from that
 kernel's own source.
 .
 Debian's own headers reach for linux-kbuild-<abi>, whose fixdep and
 modpost are compiled for the kernel's architecture and cannot run on a
 machine of another. This package is what lets a module for
 [[ release ]] be compiled here rather than under emulation, and for a
 kernel built by this specification there is no other package that could:
 that kernel exists nowhere else.
